Management","description":"Waste services for office buildings, shopping centers, and mixed-use developments. Coordinated service that meets the needs of diverse tenant mixes."},{"title":"Property Value Protection","description":"Clean, well-maintained waste areas enhance curb appeal and property values. We provide equipment and service that reflects well on your properties."}],"faqs":[{"question":"Can you handle multiple properties under one contract?","answer":"Yes, we specialize in portfolio management for property managers and real estate companies. One contract, one invoice, one point of contact for all your properties."},{"question":"How quickly can you do unit cleanouts?","answer":"For standard unit turnovers, we typically complete cleanouts within 24-48 hours. For emergency situations or evictions, we can often respond same-day with advance notice."},{"question":"Do you provide recycling for apartment communities?","answer":"Yes, we design and implement recycling programs that work for multi-family communities. This includes resident education, proper container placement, and contamination management."},{"question":"How do you handle large item disposal for residents?","answer":"We offer bulk pickup services for furniture, appliances, and other large items. This can be scheduled on a regular basis or as-needed to keep your property clean and prevent illegal dumping."},{"question":"Can you customize service for different properties?","answer":"Absolutely. Each property is different, and we tailor service frequency, container sizes, and placement to meet the specific needs of each community in your portfolio."}]}],["$L7","$L8","$L9"],"$La"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$Lb",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$c",[]],"S":true}
